{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the magic of the arcade era with our nostalgic <strong>retro Breakout game</strong> \u2014 now reimagined with modern twists! Smash through bricks across <strong>multiple levels</strong>, collect powerful <strong>upgrades</strong> that change the way you play, and unlock unique <strong>skins</strong> for your paddle and ball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re chasing high scores or just enjoying the classic feel, each level offers new challenges, fresh designs, and a satisfying blend of old-school charm with modern gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to break, bounce, and blast your way to victory!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3944510?t=1755870465","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3944510?t=1755870465","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944510/36b45b981c55db4123b7a3be05b39c8846461b86/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755870465","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944510/36b45b981c55db4123b7a3be05b39c8846461b86/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755870465","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3944780,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the magic of the arcade era with our nostalgic <strong>retro Breakout game</strong> \u2014 now reimagined with modern twists! Smash through bricks across <strong>multiple levels</strong>, collect powerful <strong>upgrades</strong> that change the way you play, and unlock unique <strong>skins</strong> for your paddle and ball.</p><p class=\"bb_para